    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elusives are <strong>tiny creatures</strong> that inhabit our homes, hiding from us and borrowing whatever they need. Humans are so big and clumsy that they do not perceive the <strong>world full of adventure and resources</strong> that extends before their feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/9e738f7df4ca4b9f6c371ae630498794.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elusive raiders venture into homes to find precious resources to <strong>help the community thrive</strong>, but they\u2019re also  the most careful not to be captured by animals and other <i>huge</i> creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll <strong>explore every corner</strong> of an old haunted house, uncovering new pathways and tunnels within the walls that will lead you to hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/2e8620b2ffb721996e1d29264ece05ae.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elusive combines <strong>exploration</strong> with resource and treasure gathering, <strong>crafting</strong>, and <strong>quests\u00a0</strong>in a giant house interconnected by tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE EVERY CORNER OF A HUGE HOUSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/a4ada00fbcbe39d49c2d096b1efb7746.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels are interconnected by tunnels, and exploration blends 3D environments with 2D paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR GEAR AND ENHANCE YOUR ACROBATIC SKILLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/d753a14ffd8e141cb164fddc52ae35d9.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire boots for special jumps, a grappling hook to reach distant places, or the moth dust dash for swift movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDE AND ESCAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/c470b1339f71be099b89a3f153e6fe9d.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal animals like the Witch's Cat and the Raven are lurking around the house. Hide from them or\u00a0they will eat you up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD A NEW ELUSIVE COMMUNITY</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/7cbcd4f74e4b7e1360adf94570081380.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather together all kinds of materials and treasures, and help thriving a new Elusive community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elusives are <strong>tiny creatures</strong> that inhabit our homes, hiding from us and borrowing whatever they need. Humans are so big and clumsy that they do not perceive the <strong>world full of adventure and resources</strong> that extends before their feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/9e738f7df4ca4b9f6c371ae630498794.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elusive raiders venture into homes to find precious resources to <strong>help the community thrive</strong>, but they\u2019re also  the most careful not to be captured by animals and other <i>huge</i> creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll <strong>explore every corner</strong> of an old haunted house, uncovering new pathways and tunnels within the walls that will lead you to hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/2e8620b2ffb721996e1d29264ece05ae.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elusive combines <strong>exploration</strong> with resource and treasure gathering, <strong>crafting</strong>, and <strong>quests\u00a0</strong>in a giant house interconnected by tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE EVERY CORNER OF A HUGE HOUSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/a4ada00fbcbe39d49c2d096b1efb7746.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels are interconnected by tunnels, and exploration blends 3D environments with 2D paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR GEAR AND ENHANCE YOUR ACROBATIC SKILLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/d753a14ffd8e141cb164fddc52ae35d9.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire boots for special jumps, a grappling hook to reach distant places, or the moth dust dash for swift movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIDE AND ESCAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/c470b1339f71be099b89a3f153e6fe9d.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal animals like the Witch's Cat and the Raven are lurking around the house. Hide from them or\u00a0they will eat you up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD A NEW ELUSIVE COMMUNITY</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/7cbcd4f74e4b7e1360adf94570081380.avif?t=1748941782\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather together all kinds of materials and treasures, and help thriving a new Elusive community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
